"P3441838099" "This is a crystal pendant created by the demon hunter Hardcase. It is used to collect the magical essence of demon's you defeat. It is now full, it's crystal blackened by the demonic energies it contains."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - WailerMystic 
