// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4027859469" "You've been getting some good info on these Wailers. You got more information on the nature of the demons through the resonance crystal, and tracking down and stealing the Tolshak Mysteries from the Circle of Thorns was very valuable. But we need to know more.<br><br>I got some idiot who came to me screaming about making a deal with the devil, and how he wants out. He was all paranoid, and took off on me when he thought he saw something on a rooftop looking down at him. If we rescue his sorry self, we might be able to get some details on the contract he made with the demons. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Rescue Daniel Hawthorn from the Wailers.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3307336200" "Rescue Daniel Hawthorn"
// SendOffString :
"P2993751083" "Last time I saw him he was heading off towards the slums of St. Martial. You can take this truck there."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1438517289" "You track down Hawthorn yet? I don't really care if he gets eaten by the demons, but I want to know more about the contract he made!"

