// ModelDisplayName :
"P715366844" "Daniel Hawthorn"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P348705736" "Thanks! The demons promised me luck at the casino, but in turn wanted me to destroy a seal on the Golden Giza! I chickened out so they came after me!<em=wave>I'm outta here!"

