"P1632408723" "You rescued Daniel Hawthorn!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3879542273" "So they want to break one of the seals on the Golden Giza, eh? Demons are sometimes bound by seals - perhaps someone wants to keep them bound to the Giza? I need more info."
// RandomFameString :
"P490863678" "Those Wailers on St. Martial are tough, but {VillainName} is tougher!"

