// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P813702885" "We got some good info on these Wailers: they have a resonance having to do with sound and music, and they're trying to break the seals on the Golden Giza. We got what the Circle of Thorns know about them from the Tolshak Mysteries, though it's going to take awhile to unlock those secrets.<br><br>There's another source we ain't tapped yet. You heard of the Archmage Tarixus? He's a ghostly dude with some major mojo back on Sharkhead. He might be able to provide us with some insight - for a price. There's always a price. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Get whatever information Tarixus can provide.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3890976220" "Get info from Tarixus"
// SendOffString :
"P1002158372" "Do whatever that old ghost might tell ya. It might be dangerous, but it shouldn't be anything you can't handle, right?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_5_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2463141661" "Visit Archmage Tarixus"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3592764887" "You talked to Tarixus yet? He's a powerful dude, so don't keep him waiting!"

